OL,3,AHaigh says EU agreement will 'help with
OL,4,Acost of food' as PM prepares to set out
OL,5,Adeal to MPs
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham will set out the new UK-EU
OL,8,Fdeal in the House of Commons this
OL,9,Fafternoon, after it was agreed with
OL,10,FEuropean leaders on Friday
OL,12,FThe deal includes a youth mobility
OL,13,Fscheme, scrapping most checks on
OL,14,FBritish food exports, and the linking
OL,15,Fof EU and UK emissions trading systems
OL,16,F- see a recap here
OL,18,FAt the CBI conference in London, First
OL,19,FSecretary of State Louise Haigh says
OL,20,Fthe deal will "bring down the cost of
OL,21,Fbusiness [and] help with the cost of
OL,22,Ffood"
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
